graph TB
  subgraph Client
    ExtUI[Extension UI\n(popup.html)]
    ExtBG[Background Service\n(background.js)]
    ExtContent[Page Script\n(content.js)]
  end
  subgraph Server
    APIGW[API Gateway\n(backend/server.js)]
    Search[Search & Retrieval]
    IngestProc[Ingestion & Indexing]
    Assemble[Response Assembly]
  end
  subgraph Storage
    VDB((Vector DB\nchroma.sqlite3))
    Raw[(Raw Datasets\n(leetcode_dataset.csv, kaggle_problems.json))]
    Cache[(User Cache\n(extension localStorage))]
  end
  ExtUI -->|click / query| ExtBG
  ExtBG -->|POST /search| APIGW
  APIGW -->|validate / auth| Search
  APIGW -->|admin / ingest| IngestProc
  IngestProc -->|compute embeddings →| VDB
  Search -->|nn search →| VDB
  Search -->|candidates →| Assemble
  Assemble -->|prompt →| LLM[(LLM Provider)]
  LLM -->|answer →| Assemble
  Assemble -->|results →| APIGW
  APIGW -->|JSON →| ExtBG
  ExtBG -->|render →| ExtUI
  ExtUI -->|cache →| Cache
  Raw -->|ingest →| IngestProc
